+```ts
+const messages: Message[] = [{ role: 'user', content: prompt }]
+for (let turn = 1; turn <= maxTurns; turn++) {
+  events.push({ type: 'model_requested', turn, messages: structuredClone(messages), tools: structuredClone(tools) })
+  let model: ModelTurn
+  try { model = await adapter.complete(messages, tools) }
+  catch (error) { return finish(messages, events, 'failed', 'model_error', undefined, String(error)) }
+  messages.push(model.message)
+  events.push({ type: 'model_received', turn, message: structuredClone(model.message), toolCallIds: model.toolCalls.map(c => c.id), text: model.message.content })
+```
 
+没有工具调用时，非空内容结束为 `final_answer`，空白内容为 `empty_final`。有工具调用时，按声明顺序执行并以同一 ID 追加 tool 消息：
+
+```ts
+for (const call of model.toolCalls) {
+  const result = await dispatchReadonly(call, workspace)
+  events.push({ type: 'tool_result', turn, call: structuredClone(call), toolCallId: call.id, result })
+  messages.push({ role: 'tool', toolCallId: result.toolCallId,
+    content: result.ok ? result.output ?? '' : JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: result.error }) })
+}
+```
+
+因此第二次请求只有 `search-1` 的结果，第二轮执行两个 read，第三次请求才同时有 `read-1`、`read-2`：
