+{"role":"assistant","toolCalls":[{"id":"read-1","name":"read_file","arguments":{"path":"alpha.md"}},{"id":"read-2","name":"read_file","arguments":{"path":"beta.md"}}]}
+{"role":"tool","toolCallId":"read-1","content":"marker: AZURE alpha"}
+{"role":"tool","toolCallId":"read-2","content":"marker: AZURE beta"}
+```
